          "Description": "select \"1\" for one way traffic, and \"2\" for two way traffic. The one way aisle is 4400mm wide and the two way aisle is 5400mm wide. The aisle width will be 7000mm for one way and two way if the parking bay angle is 90 degrees. \n\nint\nDefault value : 1",
